    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This well presented three bedroom terraced property enjoys a superbly convenient location on Morgan Street, in the heart of Waterford City. Situated adjacent to SuperValu Hypermarket Shopping Centre and Ballybricken, the property is within a short walk of Waterford City Centre, with a wide range of shops, services and amenities close at hand.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is arranged over three floors and comprises an entrance hall, comfortable sitting room, dining room and kitchen at ground floor level. The first floor features two generously proportioned double bedrooms and a shower room, while the second floor provides a further large double bedroom.\r\n\r\nThe property is presented in very good condition throughout and benefits from double glazed windows, electric heating and a small rear yard.\r\n\r\nIdeally suited to first time buyers, investors or those seeking a centrally located city home, this property offers well proportioned accommodation in an established and highly convenient location.\r\n\r\nViewings are highly recommended through Sole Agents Barry Murphy Auctioneers.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: 2.71m x 0.98m plus 3.5m x 1.46m. Laminate floor.\r\nSitting Room: 2.86m x 3.21m. Laminate floor, shutters.\r\nDining Room: 2.81m x 2.72m. Laminate floor.\r\nKitchen: 2.07m x 2.65m. Laminate floor, fitted kitchen with integrated oven & hob, door to rear garden.\r\nFirst Floor\r\nShower Room: 2.04m x 2.13m. Fully tiled, WC, wash hand basin with vanity unit, electric shower.\r\nBedroom 1: 2.8m x 4.34m. Laminate floor.\r\nBedroom 2: 2.83m x 2.69m. Laminate floor.\r\nSecond Floor\r\nBedroom 3: 4.36m x 4.29m. Laminate floor."
      },
      {
